Phase 13 — AI Copilot

An AI continuously analyzes the execution stream:

* Detects bottlenecks.
* Suggests optimizations.
* Highlights dead code.
* Explains execution paths.
* Predicts likely failures.
* Recommends refactoring opportunities.

