Phase 28 — Plugin Architecture

Make the billboard extensible.

Plugins could add:

* Git integration.
* Issue tracking.
* Security scanning.
* Performance profiling.
* Cloud deployment status.
* AI model monitoring.
* Blockchain transaction visualization.

